<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#historical_event_muslim_invasions_of_europe> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The historical reality that Muslim forces did invade parts of Europe (e.g., during the Umayyad and Abbasid Caliphates, and later during the Reconquista in Iberia), but these invasions were not a continuous or widespread 'invasion' of the entire continent as falsely implied by the meme. The meme misrepresents this history to fuel hate."@en .
