<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#mapping_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The top text 'last time muslims invaded europe' is juxtaposed with the portrait of Vlad the Impaler, who is visually presented as the stand-in or proxy for 'Muslims' in the meme's hateful narrative. This creates an analogical mapping where the historical figure Vlad the Impaler is equated with the group 'Muslims' to evoke a violent, barbaric stereotype."@en .
