<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#overallintent_instance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "meme-id: last_time_muslims_invaded_europe; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme depicts a historical figure, Vlad the Impaler, and uses him as a stand-in for Muslims in a derogatory and violent context. The text falsely claims that 'muslims invaded europe' and then attributes to Vlad a grotesque, violent act ('stuck poles up their asses and made a fucking forest'), which is a gross distortion of history and a clear hate-based caricature. This is a hateful meme that targets Muslims by associating them with a violent, barbaric stereotype, using historical figures and events to perpetuate harmful and false narratives. The intent is to incite prejudice and hostility toward Muslims by invoking a violent, dehumanizing historical trope."@en .
