<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#meme_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A meme scene composed of a portrait of Vlad the Impaler and overlaid text that creates a hateful historical narrative. The portrait is centrally framed, and the text is arranged in three horizontal blocks above, middle, and bottom, creating a visual hierarchy that emphasizes the text's message. The scene uses the portrait as a visual anchor for the text's hateful stereotype."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#stereotype_muslims_as_terrorists> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Stereotype: Muslims as terrorists"@en .
