<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#Vlad_the_Impaler> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A portrait of Vlad the Impaler, depicted with long dark hair, a prominent mustache, and wearing a red and silver ornate crown or headpiece. He is dressed in rich, historical European attire with gold and red elements. The image is a classical portrait style, likely from the 16th or 17th century, and is used in the meme to represent a violent historical figure associated with the 'invading Muslims' narrative."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#selectivelyMasking> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates strategic placement of text to selectively hide or reveal specific content in memes"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#semanticallyAdjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "semantically adjacent to"@en .
