<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#stereotype_vlad_the_impaler_as_fantasy_monster> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A modern cultural stereotype that portrays Vlad the Impaler as a fictional monster or villain, often in popular media (e.g., 'Dracula' myths, though Vlad was not Dracula). The meme uses this stereotype to create a grotesque, fantastical image of Vlad as a 'forest of poles' to exaggerate his brutality and associate it with Muslims."@en .
