<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#hasInterrelation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#stereotype_muslims_as_barbaric_invaders> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A harmful stereotype that falsely portrays Muslims as inherently violent and historically responsible for invasions of Europe, which is used in the meme to dehumanize and vilify Muslims by associating them with a violent historical figure (Vlad the Impaler). This stereotype is historically inaccurate and perpetuates prejudice."@en .
