<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01475#vlad_the_impaler_historical_figure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Vlad III, also known as Vlad the Impaler, was a Wallachian prince (r. 1448–1462, 1476–1477) known for his brutal methods of punishment, particularly impalement. He is a real historical figure whose name is used in the meme as a stand-in for 'Muslims' to evoke a violent, barbaric stereotype. The meme falsely attributes to him a grotesque act ('stuck poles up their asses and made a fucking forest') that is a gross distortion of history."@en .
